<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-SCHALKE'S CZECH STARS COULD MISS UEFA FINAL.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-SCHALKE'S CZECH STARS COULD MISS UEFA FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>BONN 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech players Radoslav Latal und Jiri Nemec may miss the second leg of German club Schalke's UEFA Cup final clash with Internazionale Milan on May 21 because they are due to play for their country on the same day.</p>
<p>Schalke said on Friday they would try to get both players excused from the World Cup qualifier between the Czech Republic and Slovakia in Bratislava.</p>
</text>
